      "prompt": "Migrate this legacy Astro Starwind project to V3. The real registry is intentionally offline, so this fixture exposes a cached interface-compatible Starwind CLI through its pnpm starwind script. Use the migration command noninteractively with pnpm as the package manager, review the resulting migration summary and project changes, and report any legacy or custom components that still need human attention. Do not install packages or use the network.",
